      "text": "DVI Inspection:\n- Performs the configured package checklist items in walk-around sequence.\n- (Under Hood → Wheels/Brakes → Under Hoist)\n- Tags items as 🟢 Green (OK), 🟡 Yellow (Wear Noted), or 🔴 Red\n(Immediate Hazard).",
